      "proof_trace": "Cache key (blockRootHex, index) excludes signature field. Attacker submits sidecar_1 with valid signature (enters cache), then sidecar_2 with invalid signature but same header \u2192 cache hit at L301 returns cached entry without executing validateGossipDataColumnSidecar (L317), bypassing signature verification (dataColumnSidecar.ts:127-137).",
      "attack_scenario": "Attacker sends valid DataColumnSidecar to populate cache, then resubmits with forged signature. Cache hit causes early return (L307) before validation, accepting and rebroadcasting invalid-signature sidecar to peers via P2P gossip.",
      "checklist_id": "PROP-56ad1eb2-inv-032"
    },
    "text": "Dedup cache hit must not bypass signature verification on resubmitted items with different proofs.",
    "assertion": "forall item, seen_set: item.id in seen_set => verify_signature(item.sig) must still execute on new instance",
    "covers": "SG-003",
    "severity": "HIGH",
    "type": "invariant"
  }
}

